OL,3,GNEWSA'People take no pride and just
OL,4,Adump their rubbish'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNazrul Chaudhery has lived in a suburb
OL,7,Fof Southampton for nearly 30 years but
OL,8,Fhas had enough.
OL,10,F"People are not taking pride in the
OL,11,Farea and just dumping rubbish," he
OL,12,Fsays.
OL,14,F"We've been trying to sort the litter
OL,15,Fproblem for ages. We want to make the
OL,16,Farea look better because you feel
OL,17,Fbetter when the area is clean."
OL,19,FHe has joined other residents in
OL,20,FNewtown to take action and clean up the
OL,21,Farea with the help of the council.
